OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits rape attempt on
OL,4,ABakerloo line train
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted trying to rape a
OL,7,Fwoman on a London Underground train.
OL,9,FBritish Transport Police detectives
OL,10,Fpreviously said the woman was on her
OL,11,Fown on a Bakerloo Line train between
OL,12,FWaterloo and Lambeth North in central
OL,13,FLondon at around 23:40 BST when she was
OL,14,Fapproached.
OL,16,FThe attacker exposed himself before
OL,17,Fdragging her to the floor and trying to
OL,18,Frape her in the carriage, officers
OL,19,Fsaid. She fought back and fled the
OL,20,Ftrain at Lambeth North before alerting
OL,21,Fstation staff, while he got off at
OL,22,FElephant and Castle, the next stop.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
