OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits rape attempt on
OL,4,ABakerloo line train
OL,5,
OL,6,FVincent Saxon, 54, pleaded guilty to a
OL,7,Fcharge of attempted rape on 11 July
OL,8,Fwhen he appeared at Inner London Crown
OL,9,FCourt on Thursday.
